DECLARE Tenure IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
DECLARE Plot HAS
    area IS A NUMBER
    tenure      IS A Tenure

@export default Whether the plot is let
GIVEN p IS A Plot
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is let` p IF p's tenure EQUALS Tenant OR p's tenure EQUALS Lodger

#EVAL `is let` (Plot WITH area IS 3, tenure IS Lodger)
